# Sample 12 — Rail view
#
# `view rail` is for stage summaries: no zone shading, no mandatory
# wash — only the controlling boundaries, the selected value and its
# percentages stay prominent. Compare against 04-compact.psdl (same
# diagram, `view compact`) and feeder-setting.psdl (`view report`).

diagram "Stage 1 pickup" {
  view rail
  scale auto
  range auto

  below "Emergency load" must 5 kA margin 10%
  above "Minimum fault" must 8 kA margin 10%

  selected "Stage 1 pickup" midpoint step 0.05 kA
}
